stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft: create
  draft --> submitted: submit (owner / editor)
  submitted --> draft: withdraw / return
  submitted --> in_review: start review (editor)
  submitted --> rejected: reject (editor)
  in_review --> draft: return (editor)
  in_review --> rejected: reject (editor)
  rejected --> draft: revise (owner / editor)
  rejected --> submitted: resubmit
  draft --> published: publish (publisher)
  draft --> scheduled: schedule (publisher)
  submitted --> published: publish
  submitted --> scheduled: schedule
  in_review --> published: publish
  in_review --> scheduled: schedule
  scheduled --> published: publish now
  scheduled --> draft: unschedule
  published --> archived: archive (publisher)
  published --> draft: unpublish
  archived --> published: restore
  archived --> draft: unpublish
  note right of scheduled: Live automatically when published_at ≤ now (app.is_live)
